command-description-npc-setpassivetask = Sets the entity as the target of a passive NPC task
command-description-npc-settask = Sets an NPC task for the entity
command-description-npc-addallowedtask = Adds an NPC task to the list of tasks the player can issue
command-description-npc-removeallowedtask = Removes the NPC task from the list of tasks the player can issue
command-description-npc-addcontrol = Adds the entity to the list of NPCs that the player can control
command-description-npc-removecontrol = Removes the entity from the list of NPCs that the player can control
